<li data-end="835" data-start="809">Due By: ${due_date}</li>
</ul>
<hr data-end="951" data-start="948">
<p data-end="1093" data-start="953"><strong>Take Action</strong><br data-end="974" data-start="971">Please review and process the renewal by the due date to avoid service interruptions.</p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
