<li data-end="1093" data-start="953">${mailto:mailto.certificate_renewal}</li>
<li data-end="1093" data-start="953">Renew certificates using <img src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=f61851f82b71f610e4def93a5e91bfe3" width="12" height="12"> <a href="https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/zurich-it-operations-management/page/product/it-operations-management/concept/automated-certificate-renewal.html">Certificate Renewal Agent</a></li>
